            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Kaangwí gooiimeek amór malaykamooduú múk kríshaanáy oo baraá Efesór i dirií',",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Axweesantí dír i dahh an dír kudá' tsatse/uú faanqw gwa oh ar dakós oo doó /iyáy, kudá' hi'iimiít baraá tla/ángw kiteeridá' faanqw awa sahaábu awa tsaa'asór koomá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng kángw tlehhemi'iiwók u xuú', nee daawitimeerók nee qiqtliingók. Nee slám a xuú' adór múk tlákw sa qiqtliingo kur aleesleeraaká. Slám mukdá' ugwa iiát, kudá' káh, inooín a ya/abuuse, ala laatí a ya/abuuseerooká, kiri tsáhh adór tar lamuuse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slám kuúng ana qiqtliín nee slahha'amaayér yaariir ana slaasleér as aníng, slám aga slaaqatká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala aníng axweesantaka a koóm daanduuwoge, ‹Kuúng sla'aarirók tidár geera aga meér.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe, inslaweek didá' kuúng tawa hú', hhu'u'uúm, nee tlehhemi'iiwók kudá' geera ta tlehhahhit ki tléhh. Ala adoorí barnaxes aga tlehhiká, aníng niqo hardáh amoorók, nee aníng daqaní kitaangók kudá' tsaa'astá koóm u hingeés dirós tidá' i dirii'i, bar kuúng aga hhu'u'uundiiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala kuúng garka hhoo' aga tléhh, asma kuúng tlehhema'aá múk Nikolai iga áhh. Aníng sleeme tlehhemi'ii'ín iga aáhh.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
