            "sid": "REV 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Axweesantí dír i dahh a dír kuduú geera nee oo alhhe'eesaay. Inós geeraawo ina gwaá' ala iri slaáf. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng slahh'amaayeerók a xuú', nee narkuwoge. Ala kuúng a daqaarmo. Nee slám a xuú' /ooslislíngw mukdá' káh, atén a múk Yahudi, ala laatí a inooineeká, ala inooín a múk Neetlángw eeharahár. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slahh'amaayeedá' kuúng ta sleer ma da'ayuutaar. Ga/aaweek, Neetlaangw kuungá' bahh'alé nu tsegiit baraá doó tseegamo, as tunduwa iiari. Nee kuungá' slahh'amu u sleerá' deelo mibaangw. Kuúng masók tu inkihhím tam ay gwa'ara, daqaní aníng slamángw slafiingw ngu haniís.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
