    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Axweesantí dír i dahh a dír kudá' paángadá' afa xaraasl badu tsaraawo ga koóm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuúng dír ta hot aníng a xuú'. Kuúng dír ta hot a didár kitángw aleesleemu oo Neetlaangw. Ala án kuúng iga sa tlankká, slám ana kumaamít aníng iwa haratlintaati' tam qoomár de'emaá Antipa lamabu'usmooeé', slám a lamabu'usmooeé' oo inkihhím. Inós kuna gaás baraá tla/angwhúng i alé, didá' Neetlaangw i hooti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala aníng axweesanoó niiná u koóm daanduuwoge. Kuúng mukko u koón diroge, oo intsaahhatimisuú Bala'amu gu eeharahaár. Inós an kudá' Balaki gwa intsaahhatimis adór múk Israeli ngur al/ayi, as masók inooín fu'unaydá' kiwa /ayi, kudá' taa ilahhooár wa hanimiís dír munguaá murslaaqat, nee tawa fuquusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee slám malé alé kuúng mukko u koón oo intsaahhatimisuú múk Nikolai gu eeharahaár. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe, hhu'u'uúm. Nee bar hhu'u'uundaaká, aníng ni gaanslár hardáh amoorók, nee aníng niri slaáqw nee inooín ar paángár gawaá afkueé' daahh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
