            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Axweesantí dír i dahh a dír Garmoó Mungú, kudá' ilaawós gwa/aatá' adór tsángw asla, nee ya'aawós a adór muqslír sirdaa/aat ar taa ló'wa hhohhoeés ar asla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng tlehhemi'iiwók i xuú', nee sla'aarirók, nee haratlintaaoorók, nee gadiyeérók nee qiqtliingók. Nee slám a xuú' adór tlehhemi'iiwók kudá' alhhe'eesaay kir ak yaariír ta kudaá kudá' geeraawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala aníng axweesantaka a koóm daanduuwoge, /ameenidá' ta babay Yesebeli a aleeya/a/aán. Inós ti babeer a aaruso'o, nee sagadiyuuser'eé' gari intsaahhatimís nee gari qwaarés as tawa fuquusi, nee fu'unaydá' kiwa /ayi awa taa ilahhooár wa haniís dír munguaá murslaaqat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng pa/aangw una haniís dirós i alé as iwa hhu'u'uun. Ala fuqtós tidá' gaa sí' hhu'u'uungo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qaytsiít, aníng inós a qaatiís ar tiqti, nee mukdá' nee inós alfuquusá' u slahh'amuú yaariír i haniís, inooín barnaxes ta hhu'u'unká nee tlehhema'aá /ameenidá' birka mayká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee aníng na/iiwós i faák tsu/utaaro. Nee múk kríshaanáy sleémeero gari xuu' adór aníng tar kudá' munér muu ga tsee/ariím nee inslawaywo. Nee aníng umuúqo heewo baraahunge un buú' ar adoodá' inós wa hariím as tlehhemi'iiwós kudá' aa tlehhiít.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Ala kuungaásingá' aga mete' dír Tiatira, kuungá' intsaahhatimisuuwí tlákw ugwa eehadi'iiká. Kuungá' muruudá' ugwa xui'iiká, kudá' inooín tawa kaahi a lu/aaroó muruú Neetlaangw. Án kuungá' nu baw, án huwár hatlá' ngi qaasaaká daandeemoohúng i aleeró. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala tisíng ta koonda' na ooha hhe'eesaak ay dír án ni hardah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heedaádá' arba/ati gaa slay, nee adoodá' aníng ni slaa' gari tlehhahhiit ay alhhe'eesaay, aníng heewí u waawutmoó wa qaás daanduú múk xoorduwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee inós múk xoordu guri sawaawuti'ii'ín ar hhartá muqsli, nee guri parhhamiis adór qaambeesamá wa ale. Asma tam aníng waawuti'iimarí ana sláw dír Baabuúeé' wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee aníng tsatsee/idár matlaatle a dirós i haniís.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Heé iaá koóm, axweesantí ngi axaasi, tí Qeeru i kaahi dír múk kríshaanáy.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
